  "id": "0080-seed-furniture",
  "description": "Seed the furniture, including the dining set whose six chairs point at their table.",
  "rationale": "Item ids are allocated in a block, 1000-1099 for furniture, so this seed and the six others are genuinely independent: none of them can collide with another's ids, and pg_laswell may run whichever of them it finds it can. The chairs carry parent_item_id 1001, which is the self-reference house.furniture exists to hold.",
